[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! Rust translation of the original C `driver` program.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //!
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //! The C original is:
